  "domains": "Displayed NormedAddCommGroup,real InnerProductSpace,FiniteDimensional,MeasurableSpace,BorelSpace,CompleteSpace E and ordinary volume,including0,no Nontrivial.W:E->R;m,M real;mu actual normalized tilt(-W).id:E->E genuine vector-L2 under mu,covariance on E directions with real values.True centered integral under same law,not outside-L2 fallback.",
  "quantifiers": "Universal E,W,m,M under all premises;lower/upper actual nested-fderiv bounds forall x,a;hX explicit actual MemLp id2 normalized law;let mu;forall a:E covarianceBilin mu a a <=||a||²/m. No existential kernel/operator/auxiliary certificates or additional law conclusions.",
  "assumptions": "W C2;actual Integrable exp(-W) volume;strictly positive partition;0<m,m<=M;both all-point/all-vector actual Hessian quadratic lower/upper bounds;explicit MemLp id2 tilted measure;all ambient complete finite real Hilbert/Borel instances.No removal of moment premise or automatic moment from finite probability.",
